{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10343","headline":"同吕员外酬田着作幕门军西宿盘山秋夜作 · 高适","name":"同吕员外酬田着作幕门军西宿盘山秋夜作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碛路天早秋，边城夜应永。\n遥传戎旅作，已报关山冷。\n上将顿盘阪，诸军徧泉井。\n绸缪阃外书，慷慨幕中请。\n能使勳业高，动令氛雾屏。\n远途能自致，短步终难骋。\n羽翮时一看，穷愁始三省。\n人生感然诺，何啻若形影。\n白发知苦心，阳春见佳境。\n星河连塞络，刁斗兼山静。\n忆君霜露时，使我空引领。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10343.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10343","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}